| <back:#2563EB>      </back> | frontend / edge |
| <back:#7C3AED>      </back> | orchestrator / app logic — one process, one event loop |
| <back:#16A34A>      </back> | inference / GPU — vllm (MAIN), vllm-embed |
| <back:#D97706>      </back> | storage / data — app.sqlite3 |
| <back:#DC2626>      </back> | risk · trust boundary |
|= threshold |= env var (config.py) |= default |= effect |
| warn | ""CONTEXT_WARN_THRESHOLD"" :146 | 0.60 | **none — dead config, zero readers** |
| background | ""CONTEXT_BG_COMPACT_THRESHOLD"" :148 | 0.70 | detached fold AFTER the turn |
| hard | ""CONTEXT_COMPACT_THRESHOLD"" :152 | 0.80 | synchronous fold BEFORE the request |
|= notation |= meaning |
| pink box | trust boundary — no credential crosses it |
| amber note | behaviour that IS implemented, with its constants |
| red note | risk: dead config, swallowed exception, stale read, unbounded growth |
| arrow label | protocol · payload · sync/async |
endlegend

